  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9084e09dd896b4365b60782f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミッション達成、\r\nおめでとうございます。\r\n今後とも期待していますわ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cdf365c027370eb47d15b1bc93a0292f202562ecdd437b543bc4aa8ebabe645",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c7feee16fae27104b508bdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントの告知が出ていますわね。\r\nどんな強者が現れるのか…\r\nふふ、興味深いわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be67ae17c52728a461621ed653e2a3bdc681826147fa413c57aa404ae52a6d57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1803e9836cb3812a2d415674",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが始まったようね。\r\nつつがなく、\r\n私をエスコートしてくださる？",
      "source_fingerprint": "58842b0cff2126ddaa210179337160456e0dc387be329ac6fc55d2ce6c234aff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10c9e7bd60c5f4f4da12a3de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鍛え直すわよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b7dd0422aa5dc6f1a0546a6aae08097ceb6c203264de0e97ca1edc5eff42be6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcd2959ecacc29eafda67693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鑑のレベルが上がったみたいね。\r\nさ、どんどん励んでくださいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdeb8d24309d35be2936f96ca884f451a3eb982eab86e7d687e1575e27d3ad95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8733392c8d3839b4a21357a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お強いのね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c08741021f04fe59c48e80f2854c79f4346a54485000cbee37df9bb31e54274c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ba7a1853e9e32449472173c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、お終い？",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b28491933d4232e2aca681cebed401f48da4a0d52c8558f2b2205088774901",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a39798fc730ba062262c3db8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鍛え直すわよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b7dd0422aa5dc6f1a0546a6aae08097ceb6c203264de0e97ca1edc5eff42be6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a2e9702fa1a03a662b015bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お強いのね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c08741021f04fe59c48e80f2854c79f4346a54485000cbee37df9bb31e54274c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceee09f6cedfab61929a92a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "記録更新ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0ec214d36efa7ef3a38379a68a957541859947c891087c58c7695fafade579",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46dfdb28aa727e3553615674",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目指すは勝利のみでしてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b657d29bc169e294c2186bbbb8f50922fbebbfd1115a6c4574e2401676c88d62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ddb5f9bf77d7afe66abdfee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b612f115902b989ff8b7859",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さらなる強さを求めましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "498c1a34547bd53eeeab2f7003ca1aeaa8337f7b3f1ecb7bf5345d1c688a766f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:083387dacdf79fd75d8e23bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時に振り返り、歴史から学ぶのも\r\nよろしいかと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e522e4042a9db45340e4dc809a7fb27385f6197f59cfd769ce9fa1fee5b22a52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85aa8ca71887b7dcfdfcd9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースなら強者を集めてくださる？\r\n私の心を奮わせてちょうだい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b2d228a11c3caeb92833de85186b40101b614d2d9e7b9ec16986e0e1d25092",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f54bbeca95ec79d3948a5cc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘、プリティーダービー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfce02d59976c4a687f79d00d7894df0b5a6c879fbee1d653e3f267a88ff06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cca241e295a23e4c4d81f616",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "溢れ出る力…\r\n気に入ったわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0129c00da630bf90f2a1254128454b4edeed5a5a1251c9ded83e80b0d09c377e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78e762daecc5970be357f727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本日のログインボーナスですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0b98b36ee01ded56319689cfc01237c27d312f92cb22d9b6f4729e0ce1f475d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79a24225d82c65d1c937e5a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お手並み拝見ね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d7a744534ec6f9ebde7eea938cb9186f143ef6960996a015e067da329d6c30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0f4b5279053dd1103d1bb42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お上手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fca16f969f1be115d50147541efde450347cb3e660ac39c439f828bbaf60d062",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6377147a891aed49feb64937",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…あら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fa11d718553d22c8fda562028fbb620aa98a3deba0469522509afdc03705f39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e274324bb69352bb74f9138c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ、上々ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63bd84c1bca5fe62ca5f167205b02c3c13216d031ec0827508507d9151419303",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:887f9cad58e7383956ec9b84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よしとしましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ad1f955c0ab9891df746f09cd41d33e661e44a3cda40c2656b26ae5570a4bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51e1e6e89f0c15ff82ddf37a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精進することね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3689e81d9204fc1ece5369de3fd42b38055481a447729110b29d5e06488e869e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e141cf43163379e1f081a86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ、上々ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63bd84c1bca5fe62ca5f167205b02c3c13216d031ec0827508507d9151419303",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb3f133a24f3c6c8e428df68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よしとしましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ad1f955c0ab9891df746f09cd41d33e661e44a3cda40c2656b26ae5570a4bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fae7182bde11ded8118aa3c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7301ae1a808cf650ecacbfde5a4921c6924378d4993ad7d4c140a4f7681b30d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5e159beefd55d7522cfd88c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "へえ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d61b22b36820165f2a049402b10a8ed0f997b6f89a94cdf14872906b648f99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3e89119fdbd004247c525c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccc0a4c1d8553a1216b70a22cc2817117c30e5db50980ed67df860ae5ad58f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09235f4995a8e19d0cf2cebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まあ、こんなに。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c35c3a64c8bf4891a17b6cf6e26aca5ef5cf0b93b18d3ab33a43dc2c973915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea53876ebbc6a0502e2a8944",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、珍しい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "621344ebc1b0982d0ca9af241515d532e887fb60713de19a764a17584e1120a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:318f621d110ac6a811e06cc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "驚きね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c4840d7463d321b703516ade6ba039151ce614f3e2e3303643e9d874075052c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be553d5918efc18da167730c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "残念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47f686705a9e5bd8c5d387edda4418a6a998a9478bcbc00ee15432f10cabfea2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dab2cc914e9bbfd023af9c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b178d83cc0c90c971308eb7c1484b589ee91f6282f0b6bf2c91167cad588262",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:468b8c27cc32400cc448593c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "何よ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8f1797688ed458f1a7ae4fd22cfcf232aa926a07a011f679c3afc549dd389ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45a14a0c2802ecf11bbfa0ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "逃げるのがお上手ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fa61c7a0ed8c6966990f9d7b3ccdbd33c15349ca7af10b79122b7a753ae7a54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae591a50a772443ca2441a28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お気になさらず。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23b27d3ab3b251b3ec98ab7e10d9464ebd6a78f77682b259deddd7b2e72bfb2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e2edcc507e1790a5b96dcce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明日は、こちらをどうぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98afd7344717a0766ea7082919560aab13afa9ee73812faf9a319c1f350267f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbdf84be5ebf1a667c171ae6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体力の低下が懸念？ふぅん。\r\nいいわ、貴方が判断なさって。",
      "source_fingerprint": "964bcbf9358b32e0ee92775d492c21af30dea06b70d50de5cc0d8b49efdc5e55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:157695bc40ea81eaf4f8c447",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "筋繊維は、負荷と休息の繰り返しで\r\n強固になる。無論、ご存じよね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6748330a0bf3dcffe617201f966d9f9d516214df6d2cd8ee067f0ae745b4119",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3f3b25b346466bab1d731ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、存分に鍛えましょう。\r\nさらなる強さを極めるために。",
      "source_fingerprint": "970b0328f132a47b4c9b23ec059d99231ae3dea7acbc9d648a5574ca67a18e86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adae1bfe46e052e76b17a35b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうぞ思うさま、\r\n最強への道筋を示しなさい。\r\n総て、現実にしてみせますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6230dfa6f5632a02a2294bad98b54eb52d702f83885b44dd874b728cc4c63b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd7cf878344f75c663c1101a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "より重く、より強い負荷。\r\n期待していますわよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae208e643fbccd2f1e28192fa61bffabb30a2030685e0a4be97d8b906c1d15e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf63175f558ec2af9dcdc0d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、貴方が蓄えた手札で、\r\n私を満足させてくださる？",
      "source_fingerprint": "230d59af3465d9696a309fcfbd5c4715153d5e78b9089fa3a572fd690e0065ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:722803c3cd29aadfec660553",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなメニューでも結構よ。\r\nより強くなるだけですもの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87ea576f614c536af8f943b209b8900b4355283b671490879697e3a3c0148dc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6812a1f600c20cacb303de8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、指示をくださるのね。\r\nお聞かせ願えるかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df862ca50fc4b068ac17cbe5a897a74755da165e313d1a23a0daed861c3cb7e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d771145f6a5c58e226ca0f06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いかなる調子であろうと、\r\n充分な成果に繋げてみせるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac985b0ce96fb4b48168044123e1a97ca1c692e1cc3c0a2550fc32b4178edad1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b1de10bee2d8237341af6b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この不調ごと、糧にするのみよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9845b1627d6cd9a6c2696c48a553fd2ccb72e1b63511edd3e72ae3fc31b55d07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:291d54f992e92e532fa5dea1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お構いなく。始めるわよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6686eb87c9dbe2645c41271e0d1bc1096dc354c9103a228e6b35507317e90886",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:929be547e1e98e18a72a5b8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "逆境にもなりませんわ。\r\n貴方も為すべきことをなさい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab9d2376344e73252792d52c5df25bb714ba09cf6e5121bc4597ad8d9f1b9d43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca304eae4a20da0297d0794d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強さはひけらかすもの、と\r\n勘違いなさっているのかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d81b1b36ab2b0d63ce26674022c13fddc0c107724ba372143891050b32666a6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf5858f24a72a344919e2cda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愚かね。漫然と競えばよいとでも？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dac6056fc7bd1c46957a6e1b1c3d5c6ef47ae22c30fa83cbcabf18d3d0dd12ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1a04ce60e780e9fa2e9d9d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利は必然――貴方はどうぞ、\r\n喝采の準備でもなさいませ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aafef02d75fef40e247a769ccea716a3e946e114cee46beba2f07082e6da67f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43ee12ff2b3fd4e5b1bf0682",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強の走り、ご覧に入れますわ。\r\n本日ここで、必ずや。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6c4d04e0588ce4d9d2a710d81e48c6aa82a7a30f87684a413da67292385497",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f53c668d979adfabe3537da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここは通過点ですわ。\r\n貴方も、この先を見据えなさい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7397b37c8a80a35d49b022c61caba738d57ac589cea5dae2d184ad7a3be91889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5605e679d5b22129b76f64b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最も強い者が誰か。\r\nようやく皆様にお教えできるのね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a32791312956878444cdbf4510b33fe52d450d5052578d8a8fb6e5dc39826024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5b74822e433b777e49c1d7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私は強さを証明するだけ。\r\n結果は、自ずと見えるでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "16e2ea65c29e0efd96095ec9baa315db992c74856c049825c438533d312d24e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f10771a35cc35b9a2a61735d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時間ね。\r\nレースも観客も、\r\n『勝者』を待っていてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f3f62887c5ca05cf16feb69504af686cd46d80fbaa92fb1b4f7a979ebda02f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d5f062a2b83dd3c4b3e7058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "興味深い方々が揃ったわね。\r\n今日は本気が出せるかしら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe4e93ea5c4ce363231f1ff20a4db5219c753bce3b57888984460bd7421b6242",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:facb00b947f4f46bd10de5a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただ走るだけで圧倒する。\r\n強者の姿をお見せするわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d22a1c5898d3a35100d2025c06be8ffe0a79d0c6bedf1bb2ceb7abf92479c94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:728fe5110323f5c8d35237e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつもと同じですわ。\r\n私はただ、示すのみ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a27d3314c1240840199f6eb12e4c0c8c4a9643e2fab2f891dbfa7de75256b767",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9e1ea27649723ab8a0c09ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子でしたら、お気になさらず。\r\nさ、まいりましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0602d87854d89562a87652687a9c579fe259597c7ebebf078e86d0eca0a9b5ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bef085ad53b450300493edd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多少の浮き沈みなど、\r\n埃が舞った程度のこと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd953e3d16dd50f18105453019b46ca90bf3ce0fb03b841069e333eafedb5a8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ed02b6a7cc1cc37ca3a0564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未完の調整は、本番を走りながら\r\n仕上げるといたしましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f913116d8a448ff2723058ecea3aea1b652b05358769e84fa559e1d9072754d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4157f1e628b26699ca388933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "深き闇の中でこそ、\r\n輝きは増すものでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0178d24c653e8eafe9913d77a1822ceb7aad7d999a595f032992f966d973b6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5e5163c20a939dedb47dec7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整不足？ほほほ…\r\n実に、些末な問題ですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a04b5ac57766d28370fb2d30fb452b68def415b18f83fdab253f8dbe4d744b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29f77e565d8d0d4f498f792f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この状態でようやく、\r\n歯応えが生まれるというもの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0474a7394bf3991e1e4fc7ca966cbf7efb251ae9b28bdcd945dc013434f19521",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83d4d83701a3846b37822a94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふん！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7f9d10469966733c1d50e88fa9e5ed490dba22d1f353e227a1fbc8b5c8e9bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:418889f962094959e0d9216d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccc0a4c1d8553a1216b70a22cc2817117c30e5db50980ed67df860ae5ad58f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b9c0aabd6fbcc940f44a305",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よろしい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f61f2fb40e2660902b4fdecb54a607694cc2ff60520306ac36ae439fa4b91812",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd45ce4f50b1a1cb035fbce5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぅん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29a2ebac998d486e987e560d4ef7afb4b5d819b9e56ff29e503e33bc53c8ed76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a957b4b557d97206971ca774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca3d96c3410a5e8533f100ad345d4f90c0cc63cf32138c8ba71bb9a0f1f3db10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de26c8d0e339765a3f05bdaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はぁ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c8314545e95415cbadeb18610f29c1e28d72193a66a67e8c50153c22f50af68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c333d88d5aa9f89594c191a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "では。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe6c54643b911ebcd5b717155dccc8184a709e95b8977732a8454b8049515dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3048f1e249f7e845ddb7a117",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbc78ca5d65302a8b38bec657661270c58ae9fac943c1c718a7fa71c2d75ec30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b21918aa7b1cbe6120b978a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方の手腕、悪くなかったわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bbfe4595a3397f9835d0139ef34d4288e3b770a3a34ad6d8db423990c97f829",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e5d2fbd0909774fb1bb8452",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感謝いたしますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "754da2127865554214eeabb3d5c2d91765ab65c01d8184ee4cbb5bc5ecdf3137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce9698efc8583b9a43e88c76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力をぶつけ合いましょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "362dc6a8d3bc39731ff4234e164708fd64046b9064388e08de5108d5fc167307",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3075b2e9739edb1974f9f57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まいりましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7649606ba64bd115f061bcad811531899eef88e8676bafd30764edc12fa46186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dce63450c9579c29d29ef3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目指すは勝利のみでしてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b657d29bc169e294c2186bbbb8f50922fbebbfd1115a6c4574e2401676c88d62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "2031"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
